# Build artefacts. The bare pattern matches a build directory at any
# depth: */build/ only matched one level down, which let the CUDA
# extension's CMake tree be committed by accident.
build/

# io/* and datasets/* rather than io/ and datasets/, so the .gitkeep in
# each can be tracked: a directory that exists in a fresh clone is one
# Docker never has to create for a bind mount, and Docker creates a
# missing mount source as root. measurements/ is not ignored at all --
# the result files in it are committed.
io/*
!io/.gitkeep
datasets/*
!datasets/.gitkeep
third_party/
harness/__pycache__/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The build toolchain belongs OUTSIDE this repository -- assemble.sh puts
# it at ../fbs-internal and refuses to write inside the fork. This rule
# is a net for a stale copy: .gitignore would keep the sources out of a
# commit but not out of a tarball or an scp of the directory. See
# examples/fetch-by-similarity/packaging in cheddar-orion.
internal/

# Our tooling: the build scripts, the Cheddar patches, the CUDA and C
# sources, and the Python sources the shipped objects were compiled
# from. None of it is part of the submission. The authoritative copy
# lives in the development repository; this one is for rebuilding here.

# Prerequisites
*.d

# Compiled Object files
*.slo
*.lo
*.o
*.obj

# Precompiled Headers
*.gch
*.pch

# Compiled Dynamic libraries
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll

# ... except the ones this submission ships. The compiled Python and the
# CUDA extension ARE the submission: the sources are withheld, so these
# objects are the deliverable rather than build output. Negations are
# explicit so the artifacts are tracked by rule; CryptoLab force-added
# their library instead, which works until someone forgets the flag.
!submission/libs/
!submission/libs/*.cpython-*.so
!submission/libs/libfbsnative.so

# The four timed stages and the client library are binaries the harness
# invokes directly, so they ship too. build/ is ignored above because a
# build directory normally holds output; this one holds deliverables.
!submission/build/
!submission/build/*

# Fortran module files
*.mod
*.smod

# Compiled Static libraries
*.lai
*.la
*.a
*.lib

# Executables
*.exe
*.out
*.app

# Directories
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Virtual environments
virtualenv

# Remote-submission artifacts
ek.lpk
submission_remote/__pycache__/